AGENT_API_URL=#Ai agent url to connect to
AGENT_API_KEY=#Api key used to access ai agent model
AGENT_MODEL=#Ai model to use to reviewing
EMBEDDING_MODEL=#Ai embedding model to use for getting embedding used for RAG
EMBEDDING_DIMENSION=#Ai embedding model dimension
GITHUB_MCP_URL=#Url for github mcp server
GITHUB_API_KEY=#Api key used to access github
LOGGING_CONFIG=#Path to strcutlog config file, remove variable to use default console logging
